{"seq":3,"slug":"bayesian-smbo","title":"贝叶斯与代理模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/search-strategies/bayesian-smbo","wordCount":1483,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"贝叶斯与代理模型\">贝叶斯与代理模型</h1><p>当每评估一个候选都极其昂贵时，最值钱的能力不是「试得快」，而是「试得少」——用尽可能少的评估次数找到好架构。贝叶斯优化（Bayesian Optimization, BO）正是为此而生的样本高效黑箱优化范式。它不像 <a href=\"rl-evolutionary\">RL 和进化</a> 那样靠大量采样摸索，而是建一个「架构到性能」的概率代理模型，每次都精打细算地选最值得评估的下一个点。这套方法同时是 <a href=\"../automl-applications/hpo-automl\">超参优化</a> 的主力工具，是连接 NAS 和更大 AutoML 版图的关键桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-基于代理模型的序贯优化\">核心概念：基于代理模型的序贯优化</h2><p>贝叶斯优化属于 SMBO（Sequential Model-Based Optimization）家族。它的循环是：用已评估的数据拟合一个代理模型，用采集函数从代理预测里挑下一个最值得试的点，评估它，更新代理，循环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[已评估架构集&lt;br/&gt;架构-&gt;真实精度] --&gt; B[拟合代理模型&lt;br/&gt;预测均值+不确定性]&#10;    B --&gt; C[采集函数&lt;br/&gt;权衡探索与利用]&#10;    C --&gt; D[选下一个候选架构]&#10;    D --&gt; E[昂贵评估:训练得真实精度]&#10;    E --&gt;|加入数据集| A\">flowchart TD\n    A[已评估架构集&lt;br/&gt;架构-&gt;真实精度] --&gt; B[拟合代理模型&lt;br/&gt;预测均值+不确定性]\n    B --&gt; C[采集函数&lt;br/&gt;权衡探索与利用]\n    C --&gt; D[选下一个候选架构]\n    D --&gt; E[昂贵评估:训练得真实精度]\n    E --&gt;|加入数据集| A</pre><p>关键在于代理模型不只给点预测，还给<strong>不确定性</strong>——采集函数据此在「去预测高的地方利用」和「去没探索过的地方探索」之间平衡。这正是 BO 能用很少评估次数逼近最优的秘诀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高斯过程与采集函数\">高斯过程与采集函数</h2><p>经典贝叶斯优化用**高斯过程（Gaussian Process, GP）**当代理。GP 把目标函数看成一个分布，对任意候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 给出预测均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。采集函数把这两者组合成一个「值得评估的程度」分数。最常用的两个采集函数：</p>\n<p>**期望改进（Expected Improvement, EI）*<em>衡量在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 处超过当前最优 $f^</em>$ 的期望幅度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{EI}(x) = \\mathbb{E}\\big[\\max(f(x) - f^*, 0)\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">EI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>**置信上界（Upper Confidence Bound, UCB）**直接把均值和不确定性线性组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>κ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{UCB}(x) = \\mu(x) + \\kappa \\, \\sigma(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">UCB</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 调节探索强度——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 大则更倾向去不确定的区域探索。每轮选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arg\\max_x \\mathrm{EI}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">EI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arg\\max_x \\mathrm{UCB}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">UCB</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 作为下一个评估点。</p>\n<p>GP 在低维连续空间上非常强，但用于 NAS 有两个障碍：一是架构是离散的图结构，标准 GP 核函数不直接适用，需要为架构定制核（如基于图编辑距离或路径编码的核）；二是 GP 的计算复杂度随评估数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，评估数一多就吃不消。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应对高维与离散-树模型与-tpe\">应对高维与离散：树模型与 TPE</h2><p>为绕开 GP 在高维、离散、条件空间上的弱点，AutoML 社区发展出基于树的代理。**TPE（Tree-structured Parzen Estimator）**反过来建模：不直接学 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而是学两个密度——好结果对应的输入分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和差结果对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，然后选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l(x)/g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 最大的点。TPE 天然处理离散和条件超参（比如「只有选了卷积才有核大小这个超参」），是 Hyperopt 和 <a href=\"../automl-applications/hpo-automl\">Auto-sklearn</a> 的核心。<strong>SMAC</strong> 则用随机森林当代理，对类别型和条件型搜索空间同样友好，是很多 <a href=\"../automl-applications/hpo-automl\">AutoML 框架</a> 的底层引擎。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代理模型</th>\n<th>擅长空间</th>\n<th>不确定性来源</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>代表系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高斯过程 GP</td>\n<td>低维连续</td>\n<td>后验方差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Spearmint、BoTorch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机森林 SMAC</td>\n<td>类别/条件/高维</td>\n<td>树间方差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>SMAC3、Auto-sklearn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TPE</td>\n<td>类别/条件/高维</td>\n<td>密度比</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Hyperopt、Optuna</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图神经网络</td>\n<td>架构图结构</td>\n<td>集成/MC dropout</td>\n<td>训练后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>BANANAS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"贝叶斯优化用于-nas-bananas-与神经预测器\">贝叶斯优化用于 NAS：BANANAS 与神经预测器</h2><p>把贝叶斯优化用到架构搜索上，最大挑战是为「架构」这种图结构定义好的代理。BANANAS（White 等，2021）的方案是用一个神经网络当代理：先把架构用「路径编码」表示，再训一个小网络（集成多个以得到不确定性估计）预测精度，配合采集函数采样。这其实模糊了「贝叶斯搜索策略」和<a href=\"../efficiency/performance-prediction\">性能预测器</a>的边界——代理模型本身就是一个学出来的性能预测器。区别在于视角：这一篇关心「如何用代理指导采样」（搜索策略），<a href=\"../efficiency/performance-prediction\">性能预测器</a>那篇关心「如何把代理学得更准」（评估提效）。两者是同一枚硬币的两面。</p>\n<p>贝叶斯优化在 NAS 上的样本效率优势，在评估极贵的场景（如没有<a href=\"../efficiency/weight-sharing\">超网</a>可用、每个候选必须单独训练）最明显。但它和权重共享、零成本代理是互补而非竞争——实践中常把它叠加在便宜评估之上：用<a href=\"../efficiency/zero-cost-proxies\">零成本代理</a>做粗筛，再用贝叶斯优化在筛后的小集合上精挑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与多保真度优化的衔接\">与多保真度优化的衔接</h2><p>贝叶斯优化天然可以和<a href=\"../foundations/search-eval-basics\">降保真度评估</a>结合：与其每次都完整训练候选，不如先用少 epoch 廉价评估，只对有前途的候选追加预算。这就是 BOHB（Bayesian Optimization + Hyperband）的思想——用 Hyperband 的多臂赌博机调度分配预算，用 TPE 决定试哪些配置。BOHB 比纯 BO 误差下降更快，是 <a href=\"../automl-applications/hpo-automl\">超参优化与 AutoML</a> 那一篇的主角之一。这条衔接线说明：搜索策略和评估效率不是割裂的两章，最强的方法往往把两者编织在一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>贝叶斯优化是样本高效的黑箱优化：建一个带不确定性的代理模型，用采集函数（EI、UCB）在探索与利用间权衡，用最少评估逼近最优。</li>\n<li>高斯过程在低维连续空间强，但对离散图结构和大评估数吃力；树模型（SMAC 随机森林、TPE）更适合 NAS/HPO 的类别、条件、高维空间。</li>\n<li>BANANAS 用神经网络当架构代理，模糊了「贝叶斯搜索策略」与 <a href=\"../efficiency/performance-prediction\">性能预测器</a> 的边界——它们是同一硬币的两面。</li>\n<li>贝叶斯优化与权重共享、零成本代理互补：常用便宜代理粗筛、再用 BO 精挑。</li>\n<li>它能自然嫁接 <a href=\"../foundations/search-eval-basics\">多保真度评估</a> 形成 BOHB，直接通往 <a href=\"../automl-applications/hpo-automl\">超参优化与 AutoML</a>，是 NAS 与 AutoML 的桥梁。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"贝叶斯与代理模型","id":"贝叶斯与代理模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：基于代理模型的序贯优化","id":"核心概念-基于代理模型的序贯优化"},{"level":2,"text":"高斯过程与采集函数","id":"高斯过程与采集函数"},{"level":2,"text":"应对高维与离散：树模型与 TPE","id":"应对高维与离散-树模型与-tpe"},{"level":2,"text":"贝叶斯优化用于 NAS：BANANAS 与神经预测器","id":"贝叶斯优化用于-nas-bananas-与神经预测器"},{"level":2,"text":"与多保真度优化的衔接","id":"与多保真度优化的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可微分搜索 DARTS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/search-strategies/gradient-darts"},"next":{"title":"权重共享与超网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/efficiency/weight-sharing"}}